  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobilising Investments for Water Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action entitled &#xbf;Mobilising investments for Water Security&#xbf; aims at mobilising additional investments and foster cooperation in the water sector to ensure water security for all. Considering the water investment gap, both private and public, and considering that water resources are under increased pressure, water risks are becoming a major concern for governments and companies. This action seeks to provide solutions to these challenges by: i) Developing a &#xbf;Get Invest&#xbf;-like programme, in a Team Europe approach (see: https://www.get-invest.eu/). It will help project developers secure financial support from existing funds by playing a brokering role that will accelerate investments. ii) Enhancing the global framework for water management and investment by strengthening water governance, notably through the globalisation of the Water Convention. This will promote regional integration and sustainable, long-term management of water resources, while water security will create conditions that attract and sustain economic development and investments.</narrative>
  </description>
